WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.830
- [Reporter] Lisa Marie
Presley's, daughter

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:05.160
actress Riley Keough is set
to become the sole trustee

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.840
of her late mother's estate.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.610
That means Riley will effectively be

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.940
in charge of her grandfather,
Elvis Presley's legacy.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.860
That decision resolves a legal dispute

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.470
between Riley and her
grandmother, Priscilla Presley

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:19.890
six months after Lisa Marie's death at 54.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.348
But how did it get to this point

00:00:21.348 --> 00:00:24.540
and what does Lisa Marie leave behind?

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.230
Lisa Marie was the sole
remaining heir of Elvis Presley.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:29.550
- When Elvis died.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.947
The estate was valued at
only $5 million, you know

00:00:32.947 --> 00:00:36.047
$25 million in today's dollars.

00:00:36.047 --> 00:00:37.590
- [Reporter] His ex-wife, Priscilla

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:40.260
stepped in to try and save the estate.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:44.340
That involved opening Graceland
to the public in 1982.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.760
- [Katherine] So essentially,
the property became instead

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.490
of a drain on the estate with maintenance

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.830
became a money maker for the family.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.080
- [Reporter] Elvis Presley
Enterprises was also set up

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.820
to manage the estate's assets.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.440
Lisa Marie took over the estate

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.890
and Elvis Presley Enterprises in 1993.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:06.260
- It's estimated that by the
time Lisa Marie turned 25

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:09.270
and fully inherited the estate

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:12.210
it was valued at around a
hundred million dollars.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:14.556
- [Reporter] That turnaround
would not last long.

00:01:14.556 --> 00:01:18.030
In 2005, Lisa Marie sold the majority

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.850
of Elvis Presley Enterprises,
but retained ownership

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:22.890
of the Graceland Mansion.

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:25.860
The sale was to help
clear $20 million in debt.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:28.020
According to a 2018 lawsuit filed

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.580
by her former business manager.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:34.580
- She accused him of letting
the estate dwindle away

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:39.480
and he in turn, counter sued accusing her

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.760
of living an extravagant lifestyle

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.070
against all better advice.

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:49.070
So we know that money was
being spent in big quantities.

00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:52.200
- [Reporter] Details were
laid out in court documents

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.910
filed last November related

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:55.923
to her divorce from her fourth husband.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:59.220
They revealed Lisa Marie
was spending an excess

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:02.910
of $92,000 per month
that included expenses

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:04.710
for her young twin daughters.

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:08.130
She received around $104,000
per month on average

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:12.127
from EPE, and took home a
monthly salary of $4,361.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:15.930
As an employee of Graceland

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:18.420
she had around $95,000 in the bank

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:23.420
and nearly $715,000 in stocks,
bonds, and other assets.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:27.333
But she owed $1.8 million in taxes.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.200
Overall, the filings
indicate Lisa Marie Presley's

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.200
net worth was negative $3.8 million

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.883
in the months before her death.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:38.280
Lisa Marie's assets were held

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:40.560
in what's called a living revocable trust

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.920
with her three surviving
children as beneficiaries.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:46.770
But here was where things got complicated.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:50.040
- In 2010, she named her mother, Priscilla

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:54.660
and former business manager,
Barry Siegel as Crow trustees.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:59.160
Priscilla Presley says she
discovered this document

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:02.503
purporting to remove
Priscilla and Barry and in

00:03:02.503 --> 00:03:07.320
place appoint Lisa Marie's
daughter Riley Keough

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.760
as a trustee.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:11.220
- [Reporter] Priscilla said
the signatures didn't match.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:12.600
Names were misspelled

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.090
and various trust rules weren't followed.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.250
So Priscilla asked a
judge to declare the new

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.890
document to be invalid
and to keep her position

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:23.130
as co-trustee to oversee
her daughter's assets.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:26.400
In June, Riley Keough asked
an LA Court to approve

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.010
a settlement that will see
her become the sole trustee

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:30.780
of Lisa Marie's assets.

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:32.850
Those include the Graceland mansion

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.760
and the proceeds from a
life insurance policy.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:38.760
The settlement also included
an undisclosed one-off payment

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:41.610
to Priscilla, who will
also be paid a monthly fee

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:44.550
As a special advisor to
the trust, a spokesperson

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:48.210
for Priscilla didn't respond
to a request for comment.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.670
Immediately after the
settlement was reached in May

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:54.120
Priscilla said she was pleased
to resolve the situation.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.740
Riley's lawyer didn't respond

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.930
to multiple requests for comment.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.660
The legal dispute played out
as the Elvis brand expands

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:03.390
to new audiences and revenue streams.

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:05.580
The King of Rock and
Roll's legacy will endure

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:07.833
under a unified front for now.

